WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:05.972
- How time flies, not
to mention seagulls.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:10.776
We all took it on the chin
again in 2021, but no one more

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:13.712
literally than this
teenager, riding the Spring

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.749
Shot on the Jersey Shore.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.451
Still, there was
plenty to celebrate.

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.586
- Oh!

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.155
- And Tom Brady did
it by daring not

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:27.293
to go deep underwater with the
Lombardi Super Bowl trophy.

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:29.228 line:8%
Another guy also
known for his hands

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:33.132 line:8%
was Bernie Sanders, whose
mittens at the inauguration

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:36.803 line:8%
became one of the first
big memes of 2021.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:41.307
In fashion, Balenciaga
combined comfort and torture

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:45.544
with $625 high-heeled crocs.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.279
- Fashion is about
a double-take.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.350
You want people to
look and look again.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.785
- A Massachusetts
man looked and looked

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.588
again for his missing
AirPod after he

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:57.823
fell asleep using them.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:01.628
Eventually, an X-ray
located it in his esophagus,

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.129
and it was extracted.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.463
- The audio works perfectly.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:07.266
But sadly, yeah, the
microphone is a bit glitchy.

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:10.636
- At least he didn't glue his
eyes shut like this Michigan

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:13.039
woman who meant to
reach for eye drops

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:16.141
but used fingernail
glue instead.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:19.645
This contact lens may
have saved her vision.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.981
Maybe you think
you're seeing double.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:25.050
Dwayne "The Rock"
Johnson fans were rocked

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.520
by this Alabama
Patrol Lieutenant

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.755
who even sounds like The Rock.

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.191
- Can you smell.

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:35.294
DWAYNE JOHNSON: --what
The Rock is cooking?

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:38.631
- And this Secret Service
agent protecting the Bidens

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.699
went viral just for being hot.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.569
[music playing]

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:45.938
A dead ringer for Tom Cruise.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:49.441
The Pope needed no
protection from Spider-Man,

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:53.713
an Italian guy who dresses up
to entertain kids in hospitals.

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:56.382
Nicole Richie
avoided the hospital,

00:01:56.483 --> 00:02:00.953
even though she managed
to catch her hair on fire.

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:02.421
Forget the candles.

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.490
Blow out Nicole.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:07.060 line:8%
A Burger King manager
and eight staffers

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:12.232 line:8%
blew off steam by quitting
very publicly with this sign,

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:15.735 line:8%
while Rudy Giuliani wouldn't
quit shaving in public

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:17.970 line:14%
at Delta's JFK lounge.

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:20.473
The guy who shot
this spectacle said--

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:22.708
- I was delighted and horrified.

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:25.344
- The same could be said
of combination foods

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:29.082
from Fruit Loops
pizza to popcorn salad

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:31.617
to candy corn bratwurst.

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:33.820 line:8%
Of course, animals
stole the show.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:37.857
Noodle the Pug prognosticator
predicted good or bad days

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:39.759
by his willingness to get up.

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:40.960 line:8%
- Oh, my gosh.
Oh, my gosh.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:41.761
There are bones.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:42.829
There are bones today.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:46.633
- Decreeing either
bones or no bones days.

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:48.600
- Oh, a soft collapse.

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:50.669
- Doggy makeover
of the year goes

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.139
to this guy found wandering
in Kansas City, Missouri.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:57.743
They removed 6 and 1/2
pounds of matted fur.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.545 line:14%
He had to relearn to walk.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:03.282
And his new owners say all that
hair even affected his tail.

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.084
- It basically wags one way.

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:06.152
- Then there's the tail--

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:07.854
[loud crash]

00:03:07.954 --> 00:03:11.524
--of the deer in Virginia
that leaped onto a school bus,

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.659
landing on a sleeping student.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.131
They made an unscheduled
stop to drop him off.

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:21.801
2021 saw some unusual
Guinness records.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:26.939
The biggest mouth, 5.7
inches, the most M&amp;Ms, stacked

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.908
on each other, a measly five.

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:32.478
- Oh, oh!

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:33.278
- I've got to admit.

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:34.546
I did eat them all.

00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:38.284
- The longest dog ears,
Lou the Coonhound's ears

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:41.787
measured 13.38 inches each.

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:45.691
All through our interview, she
kept staring off to the side.

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:47.259
- She is staring at herself.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.161
- In a glass door.

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:51.463
Of course, the end of
the year is a great time

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:53.032
for self-reflection.

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.700
How do others see me?

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.335
- Can you hear me, judge?

00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:57.403
- I can hear you.

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:58.871
I think it's a filter.

00:03:58.972 --> 00:04:01.373
- A Texas lawyer
using his assistant's

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:06.111
computer during a hearing heard
himself coming out of a feline.

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:07.479
- I'm here live.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:08.548
I'm not a cat.

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:11.751
- At least the cat
didn't get his tongue.

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:15.822
Jeanne Moos, CNN, New York.

